@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC17 Quan ly vai tro

actor "Admin / SuperAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - RolesPage va RoleFormModal" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nRolesController + RoleService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nRoleRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach vai tro
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc role
Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen AdminOnly
Business -> DataAccess: Doc danh sach role
DataAccess -> Database: Doc Role
Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach
DataAccess --> Business: Tra du lieu
Business --> UI: Hien thi role

Actor -> UI: Chon tao, sua hoac xoa role
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau thay doi
Business -> DataAccess: Kiem tra ten role va role hien co
DataAccess -> Database: Doc Role
Database --> DataAccess: Tra ket qua
alt Ten hop le va role ton tai khi can
  Business -> DataAccess: Ghi thay doi role
  DataAccess -> Database: Tao, cap nhat hoac xoa Role
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
  UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach
else Trung ten, khong tim thay hoac dang duoc tham chieu
  Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  UI --> Actor: Hien thi loi
end
@enduml
